        <h1>About Me</h1>

        <p class="Me">I'm Jay-ar Ramirez, a 22-year-old BSIT student born on April 13, 2004, in Leyte. I'm currently living with my girlfriend and spend most of my time programming, drawing art, and making music.<br><br><br>I love underground music, especially artists like Slayr, Vax, OsamaSon, Gunnr, Westwood, Pryme, and others, and I'm also an artist myself under the names hidari and lunat1c. Alongside music, I enjoy building practical web projects and simple websites.</p>
</div>


